WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.026
Two free entropies can disagree.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.169
Voiculescu defined free entropy twice:

3
00:00:05.319 --> 00:00:08.956
by counting matrix approximations, and through free Fisher information.

4
00:00:09.106 --> 00:00:10.672
One is never larger than the other.

5
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.001
Claimed: both finite, yet at least one half apart.

6
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.014
Lean checks the main theorem.
